    {
      "key": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise.0107456859504d7db744c86aa1cc453d",
      "kind": "ListeningQuizQuestion",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 3,
        "QuestionText": "How does NASA measure the global sea level?",
        "OptionA": "With a ruler",
        "OptionB": "From space",
        "OptionC": "By boat only",
        "OptionD": "By asking sailors",
        "CorrectAnswer": "B",
        "Explanation": "\u0022NASA measures the average sea level of the whole ocean from space. This measurement is called the global sea level.\u0022 \u2014 00:47"
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise.093988bf1a1942c7bf43347c932bba03",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 10,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "And NASA has been measuring the global sea level for almost three decades.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "C\u00F2n NASA \u0111\u00E3 \u0111o m\u1EF1c n\u01B0\u1EDBc bi\u1EC3n to\u00E0n c\u1EA7u g\u1EA7n ba th\u1EADp k\u1EF7.",
        "StartTime": 63.8,
        "EndTime": 69.7
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise.17bea4903bf7449e9f7bdf14233c85ec",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 16,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "Water expands as it gets warmer. So, warm water takes up more room in the ocean \u2013 making sea levels higher.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "N\u01B0\u1EDBc n\u1EDF ra khi \u1EA5m h\u01A1n. V\u00EC v\u1EADy n\u01B0\u1EDBc \u1EA5m chi\u1EBFm nhi\u1EC1u ch\u1ED7 h\u01A1n trong \u0111\u1EA1i d\u01B0\u01A1ng \u2013 l\u00E0m m\u1EF1c n\u01B0\u1EDBc bi\u1EC3n cao h\u01A1n.",
        "StartTime": 108.1,
        "EndTime": 117.4
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise.24fb5a0086d540489594fd6c559a366e",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 5,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "But, we can measure the height of ocean water many times a day and figure out the water\u2019s average, or typical, height.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "Nh\u01B0ng ch\u00FAng ta c\u00F3 th\u1EC3 \u0111o \u0111\u1ED9 cao c\u1EE7a n\u01B0\u1EDBc bi\u1EC3n nhi\u1EC1u l\u1EA7n trong ng\u00E0y v\u00E0 t\u00ECm ra \u0111\u1ED9 cao trung b\u00ECnh, hay \u0111\u1ED9 cao \u0111i\u1EC3n h\u00ECnh, c\u1EE7a n\u01B0\u1EDBc.",
        "StartTime": 22,
        "EndTime": 32.4
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise.27a2e0edca4f47f6ae0195a179d05c01",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 21,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "By keeping an eye on Earth\u2019s oceans like this, we can measure how much sea level is rising and how quickly it is happening.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "B\u1EB1ng c\u00E1ch theo d\u00F5i c\u00E1c \u0111\u1EA1i d\u01B0\u01A1ng c\u1EE7a Tr\u00E1i \u0110\u1EA5t nh\u01B0 v\u1EADy, ch\u00FAng ta c\u00F3 th\u1EC3 \u0111o m\u1EF1c n\u01B0\u1EDBc bi\u1EC3n \u0111ang d\u00E2ng bao nhi\u00EAu v\u00E0 nhanh \u0111\u1EBFn m\u1EE9c n\u00E0o.",
        "StartTime": 141.5,
        "EndTime": 150.3
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise"
      }
    },
