    {
      "key": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise.345b7c97ad0347d98f5917fbe2afd9aa",
      "kind": "ListeningQuizQuestion",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 5,
        "QuestionText": "Why does warm water make sea levels higher?",
        "OptionA": "Water expands as it gets warmer",
        "OptionB": "Warm water is heavier",
        "OptionC": "Warm water moves faster",
        "OptionD": "Warm water has more salt",
        "CorrectAnswer": "A",
        "Explanation": "\u0022Water expands as it gets warmer. So, warm water takes up more room in the ocean \u2013 making sea levels higher.\u0022 \u2014 01:48"
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise.4a51eb48020143db84187e7a50202009",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 9,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "People have been measuring local sea level at certain locations along the coasts for hundreds of years.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "Con ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\u00E3 \u0111o m\u1EF1c n\u01B0\u1EDBc bi\u1EC3n \u0111\u1ECBa ph\u01B0\u01A1ng t\u1EA1i m\u1ED9t s\u1ED1 \u0111\u1ECBa \u0111i\u1EC3m d\u1ECDc b\u1EDD bi\u1EC3n h\u00E0ng tr\u0103m n\u0103m nay.",
        "StartTime": 56.3,
        "EndTime": 63.8
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise.4abe5f23b9fa4d32bc85ef8f92efdd95",
      "kind": "ListeningVocabItem",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 5,
        "Word": "glacier",
        "Definition": "s\u00F4ng b\u0103ng",
        "ExampleSentence": "Because Earth is getting warmer. Glaciers and ice sheets are large masses of ice that sit on land.",
        "ImageUrl": null
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise.552a2de9f4d040d8a447b6552c3d00e3",
      "kind": "ListeningQuizQuestion",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 2,
        "QuestionText": "What is local sea level?",
        "OptionA": "The average height of the ocean in one place",
        "OptionB": "The depth of the ocean",
        "OptionC": "The temperature of the water",
        "OptionD": "The speed of waves",
        "CorrectAnswer": "A",
        "Explanation": "\u0022The average height of the ocean in a particular place is called the local sea level.\u0022 \u2014 00:32"
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise.5fbc89dd8b9a4282aac30d592b2ac491",
      "kind": "ListeningQuizQuestion",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 4,
        "QuestionText": "How much higher is the ocean now than a century ago?",
        "OptionA": "About 7 to 8 inches",
        "OptionB": "About 7 to 8 feet",
        "OptionC": "About 70 inches",
        "OptionD": "It is the same",
        "CorrectAnswer": "A",
        "Explanation": "\u0022The ocean is about 7 to 8 inches higher now than it was a century ago. Why?\u0022 \u2014 01:15"
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise.745260b47dbe41669c65783b62dac4d0",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 22,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "Find out more about our planet at NASA Climate Kids!",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "H\u00E3y t\u00ECm hi\u1EC3u th\u00EAm v\u1EC1 h\u00E0nh tinh c\u1EE7a ch\u00FAng ta t\u1EA1i NASA Climate Kids!",
        "StartTime": 150.3,
        "EndTime": 153.9
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise.74af47dc6088408bbcb1d9aff6820869",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 7,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "But the ocean covers most of our planet. So, it\u2019s way too big to measure with just a ruler.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "Nh\u01B0ng \u0111\u1EA1i d\u01B0\u01A1ng bao ph\u1EE7 ph\u1EA7n l\u1EDBn h\u00E0nh tinh c\u1EE7a ch\u00FAng ta. V\u00EC v\u1EADy n\u00F3 qu\u00E1 l\u1EDBn \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111o ch\u1EC9 b\u1EB1ng m\u1ED9t chi\u1EBFc th\u01B0\u1EDBc.",
        "StartTime": 40.4,
        "EndTime": 47.4
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise.7c31bf92273944a1b2d2856f3f700cfb",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 15,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "But that\u2019s not the only way seas are rising. As Earth warms, the ocean is warming, too.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "Nh\u01B0ng \u0111\u00F3 kh\u00F4ng ph\u1EA3i l\u00E0 c\u00E1ch duy nh\u1EA5t khi\u1EBFn bi\u1EC3n d\u00E2ng. Khi Tr\u00E1i \u0110\u1EA5t \u1EA5m l\u00EAn, \u0111\u1EA1i d\u01B0\u01A1ng c\u0169ng \u1EA5m l\u00EAn.",
        "StartTime": 100.5,
        "EndTime": 108.1
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise.82baaf2f99264521be08fa9b879df171",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 19,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "It takes approximately 10 days for the satellites to complete one global measurement.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "C\u00E1c v\u1EC7 tinh c\u1EA7n kho\u1EA3ng 10 ng\u00E0y \u0111\u1EC3 ho\u00E0n th\u00E0nh m\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n \u0111o to\u00E0n c\u1EA7u.",
        "StartTime": 130.6,
        "EndTime": 136
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise.87e8b58b182540a6abfd6935f7626a59",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 11,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "Over this time, scientists have observed that the global sea level has been rising.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "Trong th\u1EDDi gian n\u00E0y, c\u00E1c nh\u00E0 khoa h\u1ECDc \u0111\u00E3 quan s\u00E1t th\u1EA5y m\u1EF1c n\u01B0\u1EDBc bi\u1EC3n to\u00E0n c\u1EA7u \u0111ang d\u00E2ng l\u00EAn.",
        "StartTime": 69.7,
        "EndTime": 75.5
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise.8b2038293fca419d99688f1efaf1db09",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 14,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "As our planet warms, this ice melts and flows into the ocean. More water in the ocean makes the sea level rise higher.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "Khi h\u00E0nh tinh c\u1EE7a ch\u00FAng ta \u1EA5m l\u00EAn, b\u0103ng n\u00E0y tan ch\u1EA3y v\u00E0 ch\u1EA3y ra \u0111\u1EA1i d\u01B0\u01A1ng. Nhi\u1EC1u n\u01B0\u1EDBc h\u01A1n trong \u0111\u1EA1i d\u01B0\u01A1ng l\u00E0m m\u1EF1c n\u01B0\u1EDBc bi\u1EC3n d\u00E2ng cao h\u01A1n.",
        "StartTime": 90.9,
        "EndTime": 100.5
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise.936d7a71e64249ef80bd8aecc788f834",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 18,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "NASA and its partners use the Jason satellites to measure global sea level.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "NASA v\u00E0 c\u00E1c \u0111\u1ED1i t\u00E1c d\u00F9ng c\u00E1c v\u1EC7 tinh Jason \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111o m\u1EF1c n\u01B0\u1EDBc bi\u1EC3n to\u00E0n c\u1EA7u.",
        "StartTime": 124.5,
        "EndTime": 130.6
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise"
      }
    },
