    {
      "key": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise.e16a0dbbcee547e38a5444758100c62d",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 12,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "The ocean is about 7 to 8 inches higher now than it was a century ago. Why?",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "\u0110\u1EA1i d\u01B0\u01A1ng hi\u1EC7n cao h\u01A1n kho\u1EA3ng 7 \u0111\u1EBFn 8 inch so v\u1EDBi m\u1ED9t th\u1EBF k\u1EF7 tr\u01B0\u1EDBc. V\u00EC sao?",
        "StartTime": 75.5,
        "EndTime": 82.6
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise.f0da0521765b4f49bd9c3a5c08f8daf3",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 13,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "Because Earth is getting warmer. Glaciers and ice sheets are large masses of ice that sit on land.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "V\u00EC Tr\u00E1i \u0110\u1EA5t \u0111ang \u1EA5m l\u00EAn. S\u00F4ng b\u0103ng v\u00E0 c\u00E1c l\u1EDBp b\u0103ng ph\u1EE7 l\u00E0 nh\u1EEFng kh\u1ED1i b\u0103ng l\u1EDBn n\u1EB1m tr\u00EAn \u0111\u1EA5t li\u1EC1n.",
        "StartTime": 82.6,
        "EndTime": 90.9
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise.f21e6c3419a74111a18681598c2043b2",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 6,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "The average height of the ocean in a particular place is called the local sea level.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "\u0110\u1ED9 cao trung b\u00ECnh c\u1EE7a bi\u1EC3n \u1EDF m\u1ED9t n\u01A1i nh\u1EA5t \u0111\u1ECBnh \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c g\u1ECDi l\u00E0 m\u1EF1c n\u01B0\u1EDBc bi\u1EC3n \u0111\u1ECBa ph\u01B0\u01A1ng.",
        "StartTime": 32.4,
        "EndTime": 40.4
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise.f66cd585528945b9b679100e10f42275",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 2,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "If you\u2019ve been to a beach before, you\u2019ve probably noticed a sort of line where the ocean water meets the land.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "N\u1EBFu b\u1EA1n t\u1EEBng \u0111\u1EBFn b\u00E3i bi\u1EC3n, c\u00F3 l\u1EBD b\u1EA1n \u0111\u00E3 \u0111\u1EC3 \u00FD th\u1EA5y m\u1ED9t \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng n\u01A1i n\u01B0\u1EDBc bi\u1EC3n g\u1EB7p \u0111\u1EA5t li\u1EC1n.",
        "StartTime": 2.2,
        "EndTime": 11.2
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b1.what-causes-sea-level-rise"
      }
